sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant AV as Aave V3 Pool<br/>(Sepolia)
    actor L as Liquidator
    participant W as Worker
    participant PC as Block Prover<br/>Precompile
    participant ASC as AniWereASC<br/>(Creditcoin)
    participant V as CoverVault

    Note over U,AV: Harga collateral turun, HF jatuh di bawah 1

    L->>AV: liquidationCall(user)
    AV->>AV: emit LiquidationCall
    Note right of AV: Event ASLI Aave.<br/>Bukan kita yang bikin.

    Note over AV,W: Tunggu block sumber ter-attest (~8 menit).<br/>BUKAN menunggu finality Ethereum — attestation berjalan di depannya.

    W->>W: Deteksi LiquidationCall
    W->>W: Tunggu attestation di Creditcoin
    W->>W: Generate continuity + merkle proof
    W->>ASC: submitLiquidationClaim(rawTx, proofs)

    rect rgb(230, 245, 233)
    Note over ASC,V: SATU transaksi Creditcoin — verifikasi + payout sekaligus
    ASC->>PC: 1. Verifikasi continuity + merkle proof
    PC-->>ASC: Transaksi terbukti ada di block Ethereum
    ASC->>ASC: 2. Decode receipt log, ekstrak address user
    ASC->>ASC: 3. Cek Policy: ada? aktif? belum expired?<br/>belum diklaim?
    alt Policy valid
        ASC->>V: 4. Transfer payout
        V->>U: CTC masuk ke wallet
        ASC->>ASC: 5. claimed = true
    else Policy tidak valid
        ASC-->>W: REVERT
    end
    end

    ASC-->>U: Notifikasi payout

    Note over U,V: User TIDAK melakukan apa-apa.<br/>Tidak ada yang meng-approve klaim ini.<br/>Tidak ada oracle yang bisa dibohongi.
